For Adobe Acrobat, you would typically work with JavaScript within the form's event handlers or through the Acrobat scripting environment. To add columns to a textfield, you would structure your HTML within the form as follows:

```html
<td>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Column 1</td>
      <td>Column 2</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Another Column 1</td>
      <td>Another Column 2</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
